WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.980
Yahoo!

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.610
How was that? Was that a new record?

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.870
This handheld tape measure 
wasn't even long enough to reach!

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:18.370
<b>200m measure</b>

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:16.290
You're amazing, oneetan!

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.240
All right!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.610
I'm number one!

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.260
That's Muromi-san for you.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.310
She's the most athletic out of all of us.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.190
Well, you're gonna be 
fast when you don't have

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.810
<b>Boobs</b>

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:28.780
much resistance slowing you down.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.660
Oh, it's Fuji-san.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.720
My breasts are in the way, so 
I can't really swim very well.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.140
My shoulders get stiff.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.590
I envy that you don't have to deal 
with such an unbalanced figure.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.060
I'm really jealous.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.710
I wish you could take some 
of this weight off me!

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.150
Shut up, you useless fish!

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:49.860
Why don't you go suffocate 
in those big boobs of yours!

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.980
<b>Muromi-san on the Shore</b>

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.980
<b>Episode 5
"Muromi-san and Twin Mountain"</b>

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.830
<i>Fishing is all about patience.</i>

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.710
<i>You sit motionless while your 
line dangles in the water,</i>

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.330
<i>much like the string hanging from a</i>

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.600
<i>florescent lamp in a room 
where no one lives anymore,</i>

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.880
<i>and you sit there until the sun sets.</i>

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.770
<i>Nothing is visible beneath the water.</i>

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:36.810
<i>No one knows where we're headed.</i>

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.640
<i>Only the feel of the rod in my hands</i>

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:42.060
<i>shows me the line between past and present.</i>

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:44.920
Stare...

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:44.930
<i>And like this, I...</i>

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:46.310
You scared me!

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:48.330
Wh-What is it?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.390
Takkun...

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.250
You know...

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.770
Uh... You see...

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.960
<i>She's acting different than usual...</i>

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:56.650
<i>Did I do something?</i>

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:02.660
Well... Do you think a girl's 
boobs should be big or small?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.280
I want you to answer me for real.

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:06.990
Either's fine, really.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.000
I told you to answer me for real!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.620
I guess bigger is better.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.360
You're a jerk, Takkun!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.630
I guess they're better small.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.990
I don't need your sympathy!

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:16.960
<i>There's no right answer!</i>

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.630
Hey!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:21.630
<b>Dash!</b>

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:26.930
<i>The Sun...</i>

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.060
<i>Yes, the Sun was bright then.</i>

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.810
<i>It was a time before humans ruled the world.</i>

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.040
Look, look!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.940
It's Muromi-san's underwater dance!

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.050
Muromi-san?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:40.770
Where? Where?

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:41.780
Over there! Look!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.480
How elegant...

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.110
You couldn't dance that gracefully

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.960
without a tail as beautiful as hers.

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.460
Um...

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:06.870
Hey, Muromi-san!

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.540
Is there some secret you have for 
keeping your tail that pretty?!

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.180
No, I don't really do anything special.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.460
I guess if I had to say something, 
I sleep a lot, eat a lot,

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:15.900
and have a lot of fun.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:19.540
I found some really good fruit on 
this island I went to the other day.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:20.890
Let's all go there together.

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:21.770
Sure!

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:24.070
<i>My bright Sun would shine 
brilliantly on everyone,</i>

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:22.430
I'm in!

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:23.460
Let's go.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:28.120
<i>without any discrimination at all.</i>

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:30.240
Fuji-san, do you like fruit?

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.370
Y-Yes...

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.470
<i>I want to be like Muromi-san!</i>

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.920
<i>Before we knew it, humans 
became the rulers of the land,</i>

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.760
<i>and eventually everything we 
could see from the ocean</i>

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.280
<i>was blotted out by their presence,</i>

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:51.220
<i>but no matter how much time passed,</i>

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:55.230
<i>the Sun continued to 
shine as brightly as ever.</i>

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.940
That's totally right!

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:00.080
Things have gotten pretty funny 
since the young people in the village

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.900
have started doing weird things.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.410
Why?!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.410
Huh? What is it?

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.640
M-Muromi-san!

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.990
Y-Your ta...

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:06.410
Ta?

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.360
Your tail!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:08.120
My tail?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.080
I've had more chances to come up on land,

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.540
so it rubs on the ground.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.140
You can't go up on land!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.140
I can do whatever I want, can't I?

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.260
The people on land are interesting.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.460
But... But your tail!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.890
And why do you care?

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:26.510
Our bodies aren't meant for land!

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:29.970
If you keep worrying about 
where you're meant to go,

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.040
you'll end up not going 
anywhere, and that's no fun.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.050
But you can't do that!

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.900
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:40.810
And why are you flailing those

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:42.480
pointlessly huge boobs around 
while you gripe at me?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.360
You trying to show off?!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.680
My boobs just get in the 
way when I try to swim.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:49.070
The people on land don't 
seem to think that way.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.370
Damn it, if mine were 
just a little bigger...

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:52.930
Hey there.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.640
Oh, Levia-san? 'Sup.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:55.480
Yeah. Yeah.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.800
Getting together to drink? 
I'm totally okay with that!

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.080
I'm headed there now.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.420
We're still talking he—

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:08.090
Muromi-san's changed since she 
took an interest in the land.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:09.980
I hate everything!

00:06:09.980 --> 00:06:12.120
I hate the land for changing Muromi-san!

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.810
I hate Muromi-san now that she's changed!

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:16.670
<i>And now in the present,</i>

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.910
<i>on what should be a moonless night, 
the light pouring from</i>

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.690
<i>the windows guides the humans home,</i>

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.890
<i>almost as if it were 
attempting to ridicule me</i>

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:26.280
<i>now that I have lost my Sun.</i>

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.240
Hey, take a look!

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:30.230
Are you looking?!

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.630
So you're still into this guy?

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:34.010
Takkun and I are best friends now!

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.700
I'm going to go hang out 
with him again today.

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:36.700
Can I go with you too, oneetan?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.080
I'm going to have fun with Takkun!

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.630
Humans haven't made any progress

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.610
Oneetan! Can I go or not?!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.130
in the last few thousand years, have they?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:44.920
Have fun! Have fun! Have fun!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.920
Their culture may have advanced, but 
they're still crude beasts on a mental level.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.750
Shut up!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.220
<b>"Sekarashika" means "shut up"
 in southern Japan.</b>

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.220
Hey, Muromi-san! Muromi-san!

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:51.730
Oh my...

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.390
She almost looks like she's enjoying that.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.750
Don't look, Hii-chan.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.810
So he's completely normal.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:04.270
I told you he was just your average boy.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:08.610
Don't run away, boy.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.570
I need to leave!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.870
I need to leave before I get 
caught up in something weird!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.760
You're the human seducing Muromi-san

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.280
into coming up on land, aren't you?!

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:21.960
That's not it! That's not it!
Your misunderstandings are gonna kill me!

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.330
Krill you? Want some ragworms, too?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.670
Well, I have krill and ragworms, but...

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:26.860
I've almost had enough 
with Muromi-san as it is,

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.400
but you guys saying weird things about me might be the last straw.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:31.130
So you're not having a good time?

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.010
Huh?

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:36.140
Then tell Muromi-san that yourself.

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.470
Tell her she's bugging you 
by coming up onto land.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:44.440
So that means you don't like 
Muromi-san coming up on land, then?

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.650
<i>This guy's sharp.</i>

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.460
That's right.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:51.910
Our bodies are made for living in the water.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.770
Well, your lower halves are fish, I suppose.

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.080
And at this rate, Muromi-san's body...

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.080
<i>Wait, is she going to die?</i>

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.080
I just won't be able to stand 
looking at her anymore.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.580
Her tail used to be so beautiful

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.590
and I can't continue watching 
it be damaged any further!

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.000
What? You were talking about her tail?

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.620
You don't know anything, do you?!

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:15.460
You don't know just how 
beautiful her tail...

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:19.560
How beautiful, elegant, and 
wonderful her tail was.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:25.990
H-Hey, wait!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.480
I need to get out of here before I 
get caught up in something weird!

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.480
Muromi-san.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:37.450
Buzz-a-buzz-buzz! Buzz-a-buzz-buzz!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.800
It's still hot out.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:37.430
I should have left when the 
sun was getting a bit lower.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:44.420
Wait.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.880
Why are you stopping 
me from going places?!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:50.220
I think it's weird enough you're 
traveling on land in the first place.

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:52.060
I'm going to buy some stuff 
from the convenience store.

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:54.160
Why are you so used to 
life on land, exactly?

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:55.330
You're going fishing, aren't you?

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.090
I know you are.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:56.470
Just shut up.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.960
Using that skateboard was 
really using your head.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:02.470
Now you can move around 
with ease on land.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.850
<i>I bet the reason why 
her tail's so beaten up</i>

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.070
<i>is because it drags around on land.</i>

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:11.230
Hey, Muromi-san...

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:12.560
Yahoo!

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.560
Hey there.

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.190
She's on a skateboard!

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.190
'Sup.

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.720
I guess as long as she's having fun...

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.370
Takkun, go ahead and wait for me!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.910
I'm not going so I can wait for you!

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.580
<i>"Wait for me," huh?</i>

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:27.850
<i>The only thing I'm waiting for
 is feeling the weight of my prey</i>

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.550
<i>pulling down on this rod.</i>

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.840
So you ready to do this?

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.090
Why are you guys always here?

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:35.680
Hey, I'm Sumida.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:36.750
I'm Fuji.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.090
Do all mermaids have this much free time?

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.240
Shut up.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.390
I want you to tell Muromi-san today!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.400
Tell her she's bugging you here on land!

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:45.770
Do it! Do it! Do it!

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:45.770
W-Wait...

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:46.850
Sea urchin flash!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.480
Ow!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.480
Ow!

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:52.730
Muromi-san, why are you 
always targeting my boobs?

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:55.320
Because they're easy to target.

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:58.530
<b>Multi-Edged Sword</b>

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.530
I'm pointy, so I don't like it when 
people aren't straightforward!

00:10:00.170 --> 00:10:02.770
I know you don't want me up on land,

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:05.380
but I can't believe you're doing 
something as low as using Takkun.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:09.670
But I want you to be like you were 
before, with your tail all beautiful.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:16.930
Well, it's true that it's not so great now.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:19.050
You're always so annoying.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.720
Just leave me alone.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.000
I'm saying this for you, Muromi-san!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.600
If you don't come up on land, it'll come back.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.460
I kind of want you to treat 
your tail better, too.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:29.730
What do you think, Takurou-kun?

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:30.590
Huh?

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.190
That's right, boy!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.530
You'd prefer a pretty tail too, right?

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.320
Honestly, I don't really care, but...

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.410
I don't really care...

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.200
Don't really...

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:50.770
Well, it's Muromi-san's body.

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:52.910
So I think respecting each other's lifestyles

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.460
is what it means to be friends, you know?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.760
I think it's good for someone 
to do what they like

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.280
without listening to others.

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:02.930
Takkun...

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.730
He's only been alive 
for some ten-odd years,

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.390
and yet he's got such mature opinions!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.480
You don't get it!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.060
You don't get it at all!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.810
There's nothing good that can 
come out of us being on land!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.770
How can you understand when you 
haven't spent much time up here?!

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.190
I understand this place is worthless!

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.900
My brain's tumbling around!

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:22.870
It doesn't look like this is going to end.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:24.870
I have no choice.

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:25.870
<b>Last Resort</b>

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.310
<i>Fishing is all about patience.</i>

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.100
<i>You sit there until the sun sets,</i>

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.890
<i>and when the sun sets, you go home.</i>

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.620
That was impressive.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:48.760
<i>My Sun...</i>

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.520
Work... I want to work.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.820
I don't care what it is. 
Sumida-san, give me work to do.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.910
How about counting the 
marinated cod roe over there?

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:59.140
Okay. 1, 2, 3...

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.110
26,700...

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.570
This is fun.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:05.200
Next Time
"Muromi-san and Ryuuguujou"

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:02.850
26,701...

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:04.130
Work is fun!

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.230
That's scary.
